1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,800
Here's one test that tells you why your
RAG system gave a wrong answer.

2
00:00:05,817 --> 00:00:10,242
The right passage was in the context, and
the model still got it wrong.

3
00:00:10,542 --> 00:00:14,142
So give the model only that
passage, and nothing else.

4
00:00:14,750 --> 00:00:18,975
If it now answers correctly, the other
chunks were distracting it.

5
00:00:19,275 --> 00:00:23,700
Send fewer chunks, rerank harder, and
put the best evidence first.

6
00:00:24,317 --> 00:00:27,342
If it's still wrong, it's a
reasoning problem.

7
00:00:27,642 --> 00:00:31,917
Make it quote the evidence before
answering, or use a stronger model.

8
00:00:32,917 --> 00:00:35,967
The full debugging method is on vidyal.ai.
